+4. For each coefficient $d$, write the three RGB components to the buffer at indices:
+   - $((i \times D) + d) \times 3 + 0$ for Red
+   - $((i \times D) + d) \times 3 + 1$ for Green
+   - $((i \times D) + d) \times 3 + 2$ for Blue
+5. Return the populated buffer.
 
